團隊\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"zh_TW\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"好天使不動產財商團隊\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育，陪伴學員建立專業的不動產財商能力。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png?icon.2etjumr285i_o.png\" sizes=\"1254x1254\" type=\"image/png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-full flex flex-col\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 border-b border-brand-900/10 bg-paper/90 backdrop-blur-xl\"><div class=\"container-shell flex h-20 items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-900 text-sm font-semibold text-ivory transition duration-300 group-hover:bg-brand-800\">G</div><div class=\"leading-none\"><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] text-brand-900\">好天使</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[0.22em] text-muted\">GOOD ANGEL</p></div></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-8 lg:flex\"><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/\">首頁</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/about\">認識好天使</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/career\">加入好天使</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/team\">團隊文化</a><a class=\"relative py-2 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-muted transition-colors duration-300 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-0 after:bg-gold after:transition-all after:duration-300 hover:text-brand-900 hover:after:w-full\" href=\"/contact\">聯絡我們</a></nav><a class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 bg-brand-900 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-ivory transition duration-300 hover:bg-brand-800 lg:inline-flex\" href=\"/career\">加入我們<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"開啟選單\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center border border-brand-900/20 text-brand-900 transition hover:bg-brand-900 hover:text-ivory lg:hidden\"><span class=\"text-lg leading-none\">☰</span></button></div></header><main><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-900 pt-20 text-ivory\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\"><div class=\"absolute left-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-[8%] top-0 h-full w-px bg-white/[0.05]\"></div></div><div class=\"container-shell relative py-20 md:py-24 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.28em] text-brand-200\">ABOUT GOOD ANGEL</p></div></div><div><h1 class=\"max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.04em] text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">認識好天使</h1><p class=\"mt-7 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/60 md:text-lg md:leading-9\">我們結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育，讓不同背景的夥伴在學習、交流與實務累積中，逐步建立自己的專業方向。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"container-shell relative\"><div class=\"h-px bg-white/10\"></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-ivory\"><div class=\"container-shell section-space\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 border-b border-brand-900/15 pb-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-gold\"></span><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-gold\">ABOUT GOOD ANGEL</p></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">不動產 × 財商 × 人才培育</p></div><div><h2 class=\"max-w-4xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.35] tracking-[-0.03em] text-brand-900 md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.25]\">我們不只分享知識，<br/>更希望陪伴每一位夥伴<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> 建立自己的專業。</span></h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-muted md:text-lg md:leading-9\">好天使不動產財商團隊結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育， 透過學習、交流與實務經驗的累積，讓不同背景的夥伴逐步理解產業， 建立判斷能力，也找到屬於自己的成長方向。</p></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"group border-b border-brand-900/15 py-10 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:px-8 md:py-14 md:first:pl-0 md:last:border-r-0 md:last:pr-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">01</span><span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted/70\">REAL ESTATE</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-brand-600\">不動產實務</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-muted\">從市場資訊、物件分析到實際購屋流程，在真實案例中逐步建立對不動產市場的理解與判斷能力。</p><div class=\"mt-10 h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-16\"></div></article><article class=\"group border-b border-brand-900/15 py-10 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:px-8 md:py-14 md:first:pl-0 md:last:border-r-0 md:last:pr-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">02</span><span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted/70\">FINANCIAL LITERACY</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-brand-600\">財商思維</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-muted\">理解稅務、資產配置與財務規劃的基本邏輯，把零散的知識轉化成能實際運用的專業能力。</p><div class=\"mt-10 h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-16\"></div></article><article class=\"group border-b border-brand-900/15 py-10 md:border-b-0 md:border-r md:px-8 md:py-14 md:first:pl-0 md:last:border-r-0 md:last:pr-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-gold\">03</span><span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] text-muted/70\">PROFESSIONAL GROWTH</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-900 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-brand-600\">專業成長</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-8 text-muted\">透過團隊交流、經驗分享與持續學習，在累積實務經驗的同時，探索適合自己的職涯發展方向。</p><div class=\"mt-10 h-px w-8 bg-gold transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-16\"></div></article></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-8 border-t border-brand-900/15 pt-12 md:mt-0 md:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] md:pt-16\"><p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.22em] text-gold\">OUR PURPOSE</p><p class=\"max-w-4xl text-xl font-medium leading-[1.8] text-brand-900 md:text-2xl\">我們相信，一個人的起點不代表終點。<span class=\"text-brand-600\"> <!-- -->願意學習、願意累積、願意與團隊一起前進，</span>就有機會走出自己的專業道路。</p></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-brand-900 text-ivory\"><div class=\"container-shell\"><div class=\"grid gap-12 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-start md:py-16\"><div><a class=\"inline-block\" href=\"/\"><p class=\"text-xl font-semibold tracking-[0.06em] text-white\">好天使</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.25em] text-white/40\">GOOD ANGEL</p></a><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/50\">結合不動產實務、財商教育與人才培育， 與願意學習、願意成長的夥伴一起累積專業。</p></div><nav class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-3 md:text-right\"><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/\">首頁</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/about\">認識好天使</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/career\">加入好天使</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/team\">團隊文化</a><a class=\"text-sm text-white/55 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-brand-200\" href=\"/contact\">聯絡我們</a></nav></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-white/10 py-6 text-[11px] text-white/35 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p>© 2026 好天使不動產財商團隊</p><p class=\"tracking-[0.16em]\">REAL ESTATE · FINANCE · GROWTH</p></div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3z5q_p4msz2ha.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/153tbw49q_1m9.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/153tbw49q_1m9.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[62319,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/153tbw49q_1m9.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0hg8jbljd58u-.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nf:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/153tbw49q_1m9.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3udo72oo3to5n.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.0r6juujl39pe6.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.0wgildi0cnwt9.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\